The OpenNR logos in this directory are project-specific branding assets.
They are not part of the GPL-covered source code in this repository and
must not be presented as the logo or official branding of Open Shaders or
Community Shaders.

The OpenNR wordmark and icon may be redistributed unchanged with an OpenNR
source checkout or binary package to identify this project. Do not use it to
endorse, impersonate, or rebrand either upstream project.

The upstream Open Shaders logo is intentionally not included in OpenNR.
See /BRANDING_AND_ATTRIBUTIONS.md for the fork lineage and third-party
attribution policy.
